 herself into a denver area  hotel metro believes she is traveling  alone and they need help from local  hotels  please check their hotel register for  the days  of the 27th and 28th to see if samantha  checked into a hotel  here in the las vegas valley  now here is another look at samantha  marino rodriguez and the vehicle police  believe she's driving  again it's a dark blue dodge caliber  with license plate  6 wlh  anyone with any information about where  she could be is urged to call metro's  homicide section at 702-828-3521  you can also call crime stoppers to  remain anonymous brian  orco thank you we are going to continue  to monitor all of the developments  closely as police search for the boy's  mother  check in anytime for updates at  8newsnow.com as well as all of our  social media pages
 

